{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/0/content","kr_sha":"9adbe9f235662d602bd71ee4ed67c84dd538f638eb2dec861ce42197e3a0c290","zh":"鐵馬轟鳴向前，空氣沉悶無比。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/1/content","kr_sha":"9e7b2afda3fa5b8f3ba1fdf6be422d8ea66e9f119063feb22f47edee17cc9e68","zh":"無人言語。我們皆患失語了嗎？並非如此。乘上這鐵馬的個體均是孤身一人。不論與人相鄰、與人相對，都不願相談。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/2/content","kr_sha":"f766e2c8e954daeb506fb07e3f8bd7a25c2d53f3b7fa05e5a58538f8361251d7","zh":"無論從哪個角度來看，他們甚至連動動嘴唇的力氣也都失去了。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/3/content","kr_sha":"1d5755a93a9759d13b127b0aae718d63a30ceec6cae9381fd68edcd1638951f4","zh":"只是雙肩垂落、額頭低沉，雙眼空洞地望著，又或是輕叩著手中物件。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/4/content","kr_sha":"141506914a688b859aa6bc3e40aee4e1be0160fbc9b9cc45390d2d06a05029c7","zh":"我與他們亦無不同。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/5/content","kr_sha":"83f6b5a1126c8e179f86a11e6dee73b85192109d3459d345c3fb05a9e5f6e827","zh":"這已然超脫我自身意識的鐵馬走走停停，而我靜坐其中，時常目光渙散，視線中無人亦無物。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/6/content","kr_sha":"af74c40cda48a6e40d71f0f04da12c8151d0c20dcb6aaff34b542d60f08ed151","zh":"自上次休假起已經過去了多久。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/7/content","kr_sha":"1977cef7db14794a4c721a5e9aca74d1c9b9a4b15d64b2a4e773d2e7c816ae8c","zh":"計數毫無意義。或許根本無法計量。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/8/content","kr_sha":"bff2c6d0f5135c1534efb3c8441c52f2a9422b370221a01445d26b2f43ebaf1c","zh":"這公司擅於竊取時間與記憶。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/9/content","kr_sha":"0d542173230a99b4dbb0012c2d1c3323422f0eddc647e9fac60a8b5d68f53311","zh":"儘管清掃人員不曾使用其服務，但在拼湊那些破碎的血肉殘肢時，我卻分不清自己的身體是否也如他們一般崩壞。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/10/content","kr_sha":"1b25f9f98456a7e41be4c929ef35066a4c6eba5597b98f826861901e993492f0","zh":"或許是不覺間，我已完成了遠超常人一生的工作。肉體積攢的疲累便是這一猜想真實的證明。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/11/content","kr_sha":"1888e12a8d8d5e6f9397c181e8fcdd16cced396137890554bef7e389e65bf186","zh":"然而，即使事實如此，這又有何意義。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/12/content","kr_sha":"880d6c5d6fc0fbfa97c53d63222caffd3f40e9aac1610a363ce18ed1dd7461e2","zh":"……我的人生與這鐵馬別無二致。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/13/content","kr_sha":"c18154c434735fc5386e365f9be04a9e231439c0277641c7aa443545160e3147","zh":"行路不憑雙腳，操舵不憑雙手，只是隨波逐流。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/14/content","kr_sha":"7d53307904c03e62b2f1ee2c472a9f9c2ec263933f1d4ee697ecd96d79d114d4","zh":"僅僅攜著難量的疲憊，在上班與下班間交替往復。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/15/content","kr_sha":"88371e94192c51323a71f6272f9cc620cad44fc2c29b23a703fce070de14022e","zh":"我正像這隨心所欲、來去自如的鐵馬，那些堆積起的血肉來源於何人，他們又是因何緣由而乘上這輛宛若地獄的列車，這些與我毫無干係。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/16/content","kr_sha":"09f55fca9a21d6668141487f2586c0f68c79ec6be8107597864e03755f69b75b","zh":"大同小異。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/17/content","kr_sha":"7385e8968ef2cf203c7604a659795d6a705a0b4b3a40e493725eee678eea88f6","zh":"因此，那列車與這鐵馬又相去幾何。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/18/content","kr_sha":"a83c366d138267350c563d5248796570fa19f2bb20b731bfc52a52603bfd8cb8","zh":"我猛然清醒過來，手掌伸向了腰間別著的匕首。我可能在未曾覺察時成為了那列車上的乘客，而我卻無從知曉。若是那樣……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/19/content","kr_sha":"cbed4a4c2671963a3d028d05c7fbc657e31786d94f7118c45248faaae21f4e08","zh":"……站到了，開……邊門。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/19/model","kr_sha":"1b861ac9a569af766c94a83c17261c9d28666a3ef91617fe34be2bfa79baf46f","zh":"안내방송","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/19/teller","kr_sha":"1b861ac9a569af766c94a83c17261c9d28666a3ef91617fe34be2bfa79baf46f","zh":"廣播","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
