{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/21/content","kr_sha":"762c2c5cf0f2368ec31e27957264b6f4684e8648c39fba2f95568a63b027c8dc","zh":"看來那令人厭煩的空想一定是又一次抓住了我。被驚嚇的心緒越發沉重，最終覆於疲憊之上。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/22/content","kr_sha":"9a12b830c2e7b71fae9e96f902689bd6a3c133128e36f8b9c867f88a50a2a7cd","zh":"我……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
