{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/24/content","kr_sha":"073a6b913c6abba8af0520f8630fbaebc360ca05179dee233f7e2becf52af759","zh":"除此之外，我別無選擇。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
