{"key":"StoryData/P10106.json|/dataList/26/content","kr_sha":"f261d1a724d63306aec6656bcc5862ee9dd74b3ec54a766b338c00fbc817ebe4","zh":"稍感寬慰後，我離開了這鐵馬，走向列車。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
